infographic sequence-funnel-simple
data
  title Fleet profiling storage, tamed in two cuts
  desc 230 GB/day of raw profiles shrinks ~15x before the object-storage bill
  sequences
    - label Raw capture: 230 GB/day
      desc 200 services x 240 profiles/hour x 24h x ~200 KB each
    - label After symbol dedup: ~77 GB/day
      desc Pyroscope 2.0 deduplicates symbols — cuts 3x
    - label After tiered retention: ~15 GB/day
      desc 7d fine + 30d downsampled + 90d summary — another 5x
    - label Net bill: $25-100/month
      desc What 200 services actually pay on object storage
